{%- doc -%}
The box that says what a review has to be to get published: honest, from a real purchase, and checked before it goes up, plus a reminder to avoid fraud by buying only in verified channels. Shown under the review count in the
Reviews section and under the title of the "Escribir una reseña" window, so both say the same thing.

The text claims that every review is compared with the customer's order before it is published: it has to match what the store really does.
{%- enddoc -%}

